WEBVTT

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.757
IDUNA: Ahtohallan has to be
the source of her magic.

00:00:06.917 --> 00:00:08.597
AGNARR:
We keep going for Elsa.

00:00:08.757 --> 00:00:09.957
IDUNA: The waves are too high!

00:00:10.117 --> 00:00:12.117
AGNARR: Iduna!
IDUNA: Agnarr!

00:00:15.597 --> 00:00:17.077
-(SOBS)
-Elsa!

00:00:22.557 --> 00:00:23.877
(SHUDDERING)

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:27.237
Hey, hey, hey,
what are you doing?

00:00:27.397 --> 00:00:29.117
This is my fault.

00:00:29.277 --> 00:00:31.637
They were looking for answers
about me.

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:34.797
You are not responsible
for their choices, Elsa.

00:00:34.957 --> 00:00:36.957
No. Just their deaths.

00:00:37.357 --> 00:00:39.037
Stop. No.

00:00:39.237 --> 00:00:41.797
Yelena asked,
why would the spirits

00:00:41.877 --> 00:00:44.357
reward Arendelle
with a magical queen?

00:00:44.517 --> 00:00:47.677
Because our mother
saved our father.

00:00:47.837 --> 00:00:49.957
She saved her enemy.

00:00:50.157 --> 00:00:54.117
Her good deed
was rewarded with you.

00:00:54.277 --> 00:00:55.717
You are a gift.

00:00:55.917 --> 00:00:56.957
For what?

00:00:57.237 --> 00:00:59.437
If anyone can resolve
the past...

00:00:59.597 --> 00:01:02.677
if anyone can save Arendelle
and free this forest,

00:01:02.797 --> 00:01:04.037
it's you.

00:01:04.557 --> 00:01:08.597
I believe in you, Elsa.
More than anyone or anything.

00:01:15.557 --> 00:01:18.117
Honeymaren said
there was a fifth spirit.

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:21.317
A bridge between
the magic of nature and us.

00:01:21.477 --> 00:01:22.757
A fifth spirit?

00:01:22.837 --> 00:01:25.877
That's who's been calling me
from Ahtohallan.

00:01:26.037 --> 00:01:28.917
The answers about the past
are all there.

00:01:29.837 --> 00:01:31.077
So we go to Ahtohallan.

00:01:32.397 --> 00:01:33.637
Not "we."

00:01:34.477 --> 00:01:35.957
-Me.
-ANNA: What?

00:01:36.117 --> 00:01:38.277
The Dark Sea
is too dangerous for us both.

00:01:38.437 --> 00:01:41.117
No. No!
We do this together.

00:01:41.277 --> 00:01:42.637
Remember the song?

00:01:42.757 --> 00:01:44.797
"Go too far
and you'll be drowned."

00:01:44.997 --> 00:01:47.117
Who will stop you
from going too far?

00:01:47.197 --> 00:01:48.397
You said you believed in me,

00:01:48.477 --> 00:01:49.997
that this is
what I was born to do.

00:01:50.157 --> 00:01:53.157
And I don't wanna stop you
from that.

00:01:53.237 --> 00:01:55.277
I... I don't wanna stop you

00:01:55.397 --> 00:01:57.117
from being
whatever you need to be.

00:01:57.197 --> 00:01:59.797
I just don't want you dying...

00:01:59.957 --> 00:02:03.877
trying to be everything
for everyone else, too.

00:02:04.037 --> 00:02:05.317
Don't do this alone.

00:02:05.397 --> 00:02:07.597
Let me help you, please.

00:02:08.277 --> 00:02:10.037
I can't lose you, Elsa.

00:02:13.197 --> 00:02:15.597
I can't lose you either, Anna.

00:02:16.917 --> 00:02:18.917
-Come on.
-OLAF: Mmm.

00:02:20.517 --> 00:02:21.717
Wait, what?

00:02:21.917 --> 00:02:23.397
What are you doing?
(GRUNTS)

00:02:23.477 --> 00:02:24.557
Elsa!

00:02:27.637 --> 00:02:28.877
No! No!

00:02:29.237 --> 00:02:30.597
Olaf, help me stop.

00:02:30.757 --> 00:02:32.157
Give me a hand.

00:02:35.277 --> 00:02:37.157
-Hang on!
-OLAF: Whoa!

00:02:37.237 --> 00:02:38.757
ANNA: Wait. Wait!
No! No! No!

00:02:38.837 --> 00:02:40.677
Oh, come on!

00:02:40.837 --> 00:02:42.877
OLAF: Anna,
this might sound crazy...

00:02:43.037 --> 00:02:45.397
but I'm sensing
some rising anger.

00:02:45.477 --> 00:02:47.957
(GRUNTS ANGRILY)
Well, I am angry, Olaf!

00:02:48.037 --> 00:02:50.677
She promised me
we'd do this together!

00:02:50.757 --> 00:02:51.757
Yeah. Uh-huh.

00:02:51.837 --> 00:02:56.117
But what I mean is, I'm
sensing rising anger in me.

00:02:56.277 --> 00:02:57.957
Wait, you're angry?

00:02:58.317 --> 00:03:00.317
Um, I... I think so.

00:03:00.477 --> 00:03:04.517
Elsa pushed me away, too,
and didn't even say goodbye.

00:03:05.277 --> 00:03:08.477
And you have every right
to be very, very mad at her.

00:03:08.677 --> 00:03:10.997
And you said
some things never change.

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:12.517
But since then,

00:03:12.637 --> 00:03:15.597
everything's done nothing
but change.

00:03:15.997 --> 00:03:17.197
I know.

00:03:17.837 --> 00:03:21.237
But look, I'm still here
holding your hand.

00:03:21.517 --> 00:03:24.357
(EXHALES) Yeah,
that's a good point, Anna.

00:03:24.517 --> 00:03:26.477
I feel better.
You're such a good listener.

00:03:26.757 --> 00:03:29.397
-(ANNA SHUSHING)
-Don't shush me. That's rude.

00:03:29.477 --> 00:03:31.637
(SHUSHING) No! No!

00:03:31.717 --> 00:03:34.037
(EARTH GIANTS SNORING)

00:03:41.037 --> 00:03:43.477
Oh. The Giants.

00:03:43.637 --> 00:03:45.637
They're huge.

00:03:45.717 --> 00:03:47.037
(WIND WHOOSHING)

00:03:47.357 --> 00:03:48.597
(ANNA GRUNTING)

00:03:51.037 --> 00:03:52.437
-(SNORING CONTINUES)
-(OLAF CHUCKLING)

00:03:54.437 --> 00:03:56.037
-(ANNA PANTING)
-(GASPS)

00:04:01.757 --> 00:04:03.317
-Hang on, Olaf.
-Huh?

00:04:03.437 --> 00:04:04.437
(GASPS)

00:04:08.637 --> 00:04:10.357
(GASPS) Try not to scream.

00:04:12.477 --> 00:04:13.637
(STIFLES SCREAM)

00:04:23.917 --> 00:04:24.917
Found it.

00:04:26.597 --> 00:04:27.837
Thank you.

00:04:28.157 --> 00:04:29.637
Where are we?

00:04:30.357 --> 00:04:32.677
In a pit with no way out.

00:04:32.837 --> 00:04:36.237
But with a spooky,
pitch-black way in.

00:04:40.077 --> 00:04:41.677
(ANNA GASPING)

00:04:42.357 --> 00:04:44.037
Come on, it'll be fun.

00:04:44.197 --> 00:04:45.917
Assuming we don't
get stuck here forever,

00:04:45.997 --> 00:04:46.997
no one ever finds us...

00:04:47.077 --> 00:04:48.557
and you starve and I give up.

00:04:49.397 --> 00:04:51.797
But, bright side,
Elsa's gotta be doing

00:04:51.877 --> 00:04:54.397
(CHUCKLES) a whole lot
better than we are.

00:04:55.077 --> 00:04:56.477
(THUNDER CRASHING)

00:05:07.037 --> 00:05:08.837
(PANTING)

00:05:27.437 --> 00:05:28.557
(GRUNTS)

00:05:31.957 --> 00:05:32.997
Okay.

00:05:33.717 --> 00:05:34.877
(PANTING)

00:05:43.557 --> 00:05:44.917
Oh. (GRUNTS)

00:05:54.837 --> 00:05:55.837
Whoa!

00:06:04.717 --> 00:06:06.077
(HIGH-PITCHED WHINNY)

00:06:06.157 --> 00:06:07.317
(ELSA WHIMPERING)

00:06:09.717 --> 00:06:10.717
(CREATURE GRUNTS)

00:06:14.677 --> 00:06:15.957
(GASPING)

00:06:17.237 --> 00:06:18.437
(CREATURE WHINNIES)

00:06:23.477 --> 00:06:24.597
No!

00:06:25.597 --> 00:06:26.917
(COUGHING)

00:06:31.317 --> 00:06:32.317
(GASPS)

00:06:40.597 --> 00:06:41.797
(GASPING)

00:06:41.877 --> 00:06:43.317
(GRUNTS) Whoa!

00:06:52.277 --> 00:06:53.757
(ELSA GURGLING)

00:06:57.157 --> 00:06:58.357
(GASPING)

00:07:06.157 --> 00:07:07.317
(WHINNYING)

00:07:07.397 --> 00:07:08.397
No!

